  "sourceConditions": [
    {
      "id": "source",
      "condition": "<p>서술형 3. 다음은 직사각형의 두 대각선의 길이가 같은 이유를 설명하는 과정이다. 빈칸에 알맞은 설명을 기호와 수식을 적절히 사용하여 서술하시오. (6점)</p><p><img src=\"assets/images/20_금당중_2학기_중간_중2_수학/s03.png\" alt=\"직사각형 ABCD에서 두 대각선 AC와 DB가 그어져 있고 삼각형 ABC와 DCB의 합동을 증명하는 그림\" /></p><div style=\"border: 1px solid #000; padding: 12px; margin: 10px 0;\">직사각형 $\\text{ABCD}$에서 두 대각선 $\\text{AC}$와 $\\text{DB}$를 그으면,<br/>$\\triangle\\text{ABC}$와 $\\triangle\\text{DCB}$에서<br/>$\\angle\\text{ABC} = \\angle\\text{DCB} = 90^\\circ \\cdots\\cdots$ ①<br/>$\\overline{\\text{BC}}$는 공통 $\\cdots\\cdots$ ②<br/>(1) [ &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ] $\\cdots\\cdots$ ③<br/>①, ②, ③에 의하여 $\\triangle\\text{ABC} \\equiv \\triangle\\text{DCB} (\\text{SAS 합동})$이므로<br/>(2) [ &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ]이다. 즉, 직사각형의 두 대각선의 길이는 같다.</div>",
      "mappedTo": "PRESERVED_ARCHIVE_BANK"
    },
